==Battleground==
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.
*4 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[H. Nah]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*3 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*10 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage leaves you no time to think before bombarding you with various high-pressure enemies. Use [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] to tank the Angel enemies, and [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]]/[[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Drama Cats]] for Area Attacks against the Gabriels and Heavenly Hippoes. You'll want to save up some cash for [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]], as they will be crucial to handling each of the Angelic Gory waves without spending obscene amounts of cash.

